Error [E0112]: Decimal (an exact base-10 number) can't use `:Fixed(n)`
  --> tests/ui/fixed_interpolation_non_float.jet:3:13
    |
  3 |     print("{count:Fixed(2)}")
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: Fixed interpolation uses `core.text.fmt.decimal`, which formats `Float` or exact `Int` values
 Fix: Pass a `Float` or exact `Int`, or use bare interpolation for this value
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
